  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To use this template, copy the following code and fill in the appropriate fields.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Syntax\">Syntax</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<pre>{{infobox location\n | title         = \n | image         = [e.g. \"Example.jpg\"]\n | imagewidth    = [e.g. \"150\"] [default: 210 pixels]\n | imagecaption  = \n | map           = [e.g. \"Example.jpg\"]\n | mapwidth      = [e.g. \"150\"] [default: 210 pixels]\n | mapcaption    = \n | type          = \n | level         = \n | location      = \n | inhabitants   = \n}}\n</pre>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Samples\">Samples</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<pre>{{infobox location\n | title         = Flora Island\n | image         = Example.jpg\n | imagecaption  = The island\n | map           = Example.jpg\n | mapcaption    = Zone map\n | type          = Contested\n | level         = 1-5\n | location      = Earth\n | inhabitants   = Stompy Humans, Drinky Bees\n}}\n</pre>\n<p>Results in...\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikia-infobox\">\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"wikia-infobox-header\" colspan=\"2\">Flora Island\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wikia-infobox-image\" colspan=\"2\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ucp-internal-test-starter-commons/images/a/a9/Example.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200817123015\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"The island\"><img alt=\"The island\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ucp-internal-test-starter-commons/images/a/a9/Example.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200817123015\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"210\" height=\"210\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Example.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Example.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wikia-infobox-caption\" colspan=\"2\">The island\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wikia-infobox-image\" colspan=\"2\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ucp-internal-test-starter-commons/images/a/a9/Example.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200817123015\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Zone map\"><img alt=\"Zone map\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ucp-internal-test-starter-commons/images/a/a9/Example.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200817123015\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"210\" height=\"210\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Example.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Example.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wikia-infobox-caption\" colspan=\"2\">Zone map\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><div class=\"wikia-infobox-section-header\">Vital statistics</div>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Type\n</th>\n<td>Contested\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Level\n</th>\n<td>1-5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Location\n</th>\n<td>Earth\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Inhabitants\n</th>\n<td>Stompy Humans, Drinky Bees\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-size:0; line-height:0;\">\n<th style=\"width:50%; padding:0\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:50%; padding:0\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205359\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.012 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 71/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 980/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 153/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 671/5000000 bytes\n-->\n